<title>USA: Dove Meadows MUD, Texas, won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Dove Meadows MUD, Texas, won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker, Inc said it won $1.565 million of Dove Meadows Municipal Utility District, Texas, waterworks and sewer system combination unlimited tax and revenue bonds, series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.8291 percent.</p>
